            <description><![CDATA[Git 是一个分布式版本控制系统，用于跟踪文件的更改，尤其是程序代码。它可以帮助多人协作开发，并保持代码历史的记录。本文将介绍 Git 的一些基本命令和常见操作。]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Git 是一个分布式版本控制系统，用于跟踪文件的更改，尤其是程序代码。它可以帮助多人协作开发，并保持代码历史的记录。本文将介绍 Git 的一些基本命令和常见操作。</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="1-安装-git">1. 安装 Git<a href="https://parrotbaobao.github.io/parrotbaobao/blog/2020/02/26/git-basic-usage#1-%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85-git" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 1. 安装 Git" title="Direct link to 1. 安装 Git">​</a></h2>
<p>首先，你需要在你的计算机上安装 Git。你可以访问 <a href="https://git-scm.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Git 官网</a> 下载并安装。</p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"># 在终端中输入以下命令，检查 Git 是否安装成功</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git --version</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>如果 Git 安装成功，你将看到 Git 的版本信息。</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="2-git-基本概念">2. Git 基本概念<a href="https://parrotbaobao.github.io/parrotbaobao/blog/2020/02/26/git-basic-usage#2-git-%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 2. Git 基本概念" title="Direct link to 2. Git 基本概念">​</a></h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>仓库（Repository）：</strong> 存储项目所有文件和历史记录的地方。</li>
<li><strong>工作区（Working Directory）：</strong> 你在本地计算机上编辑文件的目录。</li>
<li><strong>暂存区（Staging Area）：</strong> 用于存放你想要提交的更改。</li>
<li><strong>提交（Commit）：</strong> 将暂存区的更改保存到仓库的历史记录中。</li>
<li><strong>分支（Branch）：</strong> 用于并行开发的不同代码版本。</li>
<li><strong>合并（Merge）：</strong> 将不同分支的更改合并到一起。</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="3-git-常用命令">3. Git 常用命令<a href="https://parrotbaobao.github.io/parrotbaobao/blog/2020/02/26/git-basic-usage#3-git-%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 3. Git 常用命令" title="Direct link to 3. Git 常用命令">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="31-初始化仓库">3.1 初始化仓库<a href="https://parrotbaobao.github.io/parrotbaobao/blog/2020/02/26/git-basic-usage#31-%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 3.1 初始化仓库" title="Direct link to 3.1 初始化仓库">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"># 在项目根目录下初始化 Git 仓库</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git init</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="32-添加文件到暂存区">3.2 添加文件到暂存区<a href="https://parrotbaobao.github.io/parrotbaobao/blog/2020/02/26/git-basic-usage#32-%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E5%88%B0%E6%9A%82%E5%AD%98%E5%8C%BA" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 3.2 添加文件到暂存区" title="Direct link to 3.2 添加文件到暂存区">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"># 添加单个文件到暂存区</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git add &lt;文件名&gt;</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"># 添加所有更改的文件到暂存区</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git add .</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="33-提交更改">3.3 提交更改<a href="https://parrotbaobao.github.io/parrotbaobao/blog/2020/02/26/git-basic-usage#33-%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E6%9B%B4%E6%94%B9" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 3.3 提交更改" title="Direct link to 3.3 提交更改">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"># 提交暂存区的更改，并添加提交信息</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git commit -m "提交信息"</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="34-查看仓库状态">3.4 查看仓库状态<a href="https://parrotbaobao.github.io/parrotbaobao/blog/2020/02/26/git-basic-usage#34-%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 3.4 查看仓库状态" title="Direct link to 3.4 查看仓库状态">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"># 查看当前仓库的状态，包括已修改但未暂存的文件，以及已暂存但未提交的文件</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git status</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="35-查看提交历史">3.5 查看提交历史<a href="https://parrotbaobao.github.io/parrotbaobao/blog/2020/02/26/git-basic-usage#35-%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 3.5 查看提交历史" title="Direct link to 3.5 查看提交历史">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"># 查看提交历史记录</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git log</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="36-创建和切换分支">3.6 创建和切换分支<a href="https://parrotbaobao.github.io/parrotbaobao/blog/2020/02/26/git-basic-usage#36-%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E5%92%8C%E5%88%87%E6%8D%A2%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 3.6 创建和切换分支" title="Direct link to 3.6 创建和切换分支">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"># 创建一个新的分支</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git branch &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"># 切换到指定分支</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git checkout &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"># 创建并切换到新的分支（常用）</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git checkout -b &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="37-合并分支">3.7 合并分支<a href="https://parrotbaobao.github.io/parrotbaobao/blog/2020/02/26/git-basic-usage#37-%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 3.7 合并分支" title="Direct link to 3.7 合并分支">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"># 切换到要合并到的目标分支</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git checkout &lt;目标分支&gt;</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"># 将指定分支的更改合并到当前分支</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git merge &lt;要合并的分支&gt;</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="38-远程仓库">3.8 远程仓库<a href="https://parrotbaobao.github.io/parrotbaobao/blog/2020/02/26/git-basic-usage#38-%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 3.8 远程仓库" title="Direct link to 3.8 远程仓库">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>克隆远程仓库：</strong></p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git clone &lt;远程仓库地址&gt;</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>添加远程仓库：</strong></p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git remote add origin &lt;远程仓库地址&gt;</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>推送本地分支到远程仓库：</strong></p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git push origin &lt;本地分支名&gt;:&lt;远程分支名&gt;</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain"># 如果本地分支名和远程分支名相同，可以简写为：</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git push origin &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>从远程仓库拉取更新：</strong></p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git pull origin &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="4-常见-git-操作">4. 常见 Git 操作<a href="https://parrotbaobao.github.io/parrotbaobao/blog/2020/02/26/git-basic-usage#4-%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81-git-%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 4. 常见 Git 操作" title="Direct link to 4. 常见 Git 操作">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="41-撤销更改">4.1 撤销更改<a href="https://parrotbaobao.github.io/parrotbaobao/blog/2020/02/26/git-basic-usage#41-%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E6%9B%B4%E6%94%B9" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 4.1 撤销更改" title="Direct link to 4.1 撤销更改">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>撤销工作区的更改：</strong></p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git checkout -- &lt;文件名&gt;</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>撤销暂存区的更改：</strong></p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#bfc7d5;--prism-background-color:#292d3e"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#bfc7d5;background-color:#292d3e"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#bfc7d5"><span class="token plain">git reset HEAD &lt;文件名&gt;</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="42-解决冲突">4.2 解决冲突<a href="https://parrotbaobao.github.io/parrotbaobao/blog/2020/02/26/git-basic-usage#42-%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E5%86%B2%E7%AA%81" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 4.2 解决冲突" title="Direct link to 4.2 解决冲突">​</a></h3>
<p>当合并分支时，如果不同分支对同一文件进行了不同的修改，可能会发生冲突。你需要手动解决冲突，然后重新提交。</p>
<ol>
<li>打开包含冲突的文件。</li>
<li>查找包含 <code>&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;</code>，<code>=======</code> 和 <code>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;</code> 的部分。</li>
<li>手动编辑文件，选择要保留的更改，并删除冲突标记。</li>
<li>将解决冲突后的文件添加到暂存区。</li>
<li>提交更改。</li>
</ol>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="5-总结">5. 总结<a href="https://parrotbaobao.github.io/parrotbaobao/blog/2020/02/26/git-basic-usage#5-%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 5. 总结" title="Direct link to 5. 总结">​</a></h2>
<p>本文介绍了 Git 的一些基本概念和常用命令。希望这些信息能帮助你开始使用 Git 进行版本控制。</p>
